  characterNames:
  - Morwen
  - Ashen
  - Corvin
  characterDescriptions:
  - She is the youngest of the three. Her red hair shimmering like a ruby in the
    moonlight. Seeing her bubbly personality will sure make you smile!
  - They are the middle child, but no less loved. Their personality is surprisingly
    similar to a cat, it might make you wonder if they secretly are one...
  - He is the oldest. He may look intimidating, but don't let his looks scare you.
    Once you get to know him, he will become your best friend for sure.
